# RavenWire MVP starter rules.
#
# This deliberately low-noise rule keeps Suricata's detect engine active in a
# fresh install and gives operators a known SID for pipeline smoke tests. Replace
# or extend this file through rule deployment before using the sensor in earnest.

alert tcp any any -> $HOME_NET 65000 (msg:"RavenWire MVP starter rule: TCP 65000 observed"; flow:to_server; classtype:misc-activity; sid:9000001; rev:1;)
